<section class="site-feedback" aria-labelledby="feedback-title">
<span class="section-sticker sticky" style="--tilt: 3deg">Your perspective</span>
<h2 id="feedback-title">I treat this website as a product. Has it given you a sense of who I am and the value I could bring?</h2>
<div class="feedback-votes" role="group" aria-label="Has this website given you a sense of who I am and my value?">
<button type="button" data-vote="up">👍 <span>Yes, clearly</span></button><button type="button" data-vote="down">👎 <span>Not quite yet</span></button>
</div>
<p class="feedback-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
<form class="feedback-followup" hidden><label for="feedback-comment">What would you like to understand better? <span>(Optional)</span></label><textarea id="feedback-comment" rows="3" maxlength="2000"></textarea><button type="submit">Send comment</button></form>
</section>